              <hi type="italic"><reference osisRef="1Sam.17.28">1 Samuel 17:28</reference>; <reference osisRef="2Sam.16.3">2 Samuel 16:3</reference>; <reference osisRef="2Sam.1.9-2Sam.1.10">2 Samuel 1:9-10</reference>, <reference osisRef="2Sam.1.15-2Sam.1.16">15-16</reference>; </hi>
